00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.120
And here, we have like cold brew-

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:03.953
- [Kelly] Everywhere.

00:01:03.953 --> 00:01:04.786
- Yeah, everywhere.
- Yeah.

00:01:04.786 --> 00:01:05.619
- Yeah.

00:01:05.619 --> 00:01:07.320
- Well, I know that you've
talked about this a billion times

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.670
but my family will actually
kill me if I don't bring it up.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.340
