but like, I love this movie.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.440
- How can you get mad at that?
- And I know it's...

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:18.150
Well, I'm just saying, it's been a minute,

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:19.710
so maybe we shouldn't.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.262
It's one of my
(audience cheering)

00:01:21.262 --> 00:01:22.095
favorite.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.360
I have never...

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.670
Like I spend Christmas with you,

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:29.700
everyone does, that's an incredible thing.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:32.520
To make so many movie shows, music,

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:35.250
but to have this thing that's
like so culturally just

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:37.170
in our brains and in our...

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:39.450
Every year, different generations.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:40.980
- No, no, no.
- Very few people are part

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:41.820
