00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.640
- No, I did not.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:45.473
I did-
- Okay.

00:01:45.473 --> 00:01:46.306
- An interview yesterday...

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:50.670
You know, I'm midlife so I'm
going through many important

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:53.820
