00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:57.720
Seizing beautiful, learning how
to appreciate what you have.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:00.017
And so I get really... (laughs)

00:02:00.017 --> 00:02:01.202
I'm gonna cry.

00:02:01.202 --> 00:02:02.035
- Oh, you get emotional by it?
- No, no.

00:02:02.035 --> 00:02:04.920
Christmas vacation, it's so touching.

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:06.570
- Yeah.
- That every year,

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:07.403
as a little...

00:02:07.403 --> 00:02:09.120
I was just 15.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.410
Sorry, I didn't mean to cry.
- That's so...

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:12.198
No, look. I cry so much on this show.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:13.031
(audience cheering)
- No, no.

00:02:13.031 --> 00:02:14.133
- They have it here for me.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.560
- It's an incredible thing though,

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.730
to be a part of people's lives
- All people-

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:18.690
- every Christmas,

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:19.523
- They're like,
(Kelly speaks faintly)

00:02:19.523 --> 00:02:20.877
- "You're a part of my family."

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:25.500
People who've lost their
parents or whatever,

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.450
and what it meant to them.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:28.283
It's a tradition.

00:02:28.283 --> 00:02:29.116
- You're a part of those memories.

00:02:29.116 --> 00:02:30.600
- And so what I'm saying is, no,

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:35.600
you can never imagine
that is ever gonna happen

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:36.713
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:36.713 --> 00:02:37.546
- In a film you do.

00:02:37.546 --> 00:02:39.510
I was just 15 years old.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.650
- That's so crazy young.

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:41.483
- Yeah.

00:02:41.483 --> 00:02:42.316
- Wow.
- Chevy Chase

00:02:42.316 --> 00:02:43.260
is really supportive.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.540
Johnny Galecki who, of course, who went on

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.933
to do "Big Bang Theory"
and many other things.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.490
And we were just the new
Griswold kids at that time.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.780
- It was amazing.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:55.670
Anyway, I had to bring it up-
- Every year.

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:57.509
- Or my family would kill me.

00:02:57.509 --> 00:02:58.409
(audience cheering)
So, this show you're

00:02:58.409 --> 00:02:59.760
